        "Frontmatter Pattern": "Use shared fields first, then database-specific fields.\n\n```yaml\n---\ntitle: Example Entry\ntype: creature\ncategory: Forest Beasts\nvisibility: public\nlore_status: Common Knowledge\ntags:\n  - example\n---\n```",
