      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Arcane Exchange\"\nslug: \"arcane-exchange\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 5\"\ntier: \"Tier 5\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"Arcane Reactor Rank 4 or Scaling Creation Rank 4\"\ncost: \"1 Talent Point\"\ncooldown: \"Active / GM-defined\"\nscaling: \"Transmutation scope, safety, and value ceiling improve by rank.\"\nsynergy: \"Material transmutation based on equivalent exchange; connects to crafting, soul catalysts, and rare materials.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-5\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 18\n---\n\n# Arcane Exchange\n\n## Overview\nTransmutation scope, safety, and value ceiling improve by rank.\n\n## Rank 1\nTransmute simple and common materials through equivalent exchange.\n\n## Rank 2\nImprove exchange efficiency and material range.\n\n## Rank 3\nTransmute more complex crafted or refined materials.\n\n## Rank 4\nWork with rare materials under stricter exchange limits.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaster high-tier Arcane Exchange with GM-approved limits.\n\n## Prerequisites\nArcane Reactor Rank 4 or Scaling Creation Rank 4\n\n## Scaling\nTransmutation scope, safety, and value ceiling improve by rank.\n\n## Synergy\nMaterial transmutation based on equivalent exchange; connects to crafting, soul catalysts, and rare materials.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n",
