      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Combat Alchemy\"\nslug: \"combat-alchemy\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 3\"\ntier: \"Tier 3\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"Artificer Discipline Rank 3 or Alchemy access\"\ncost: \"1 Talent Point\"\ncooldown: \"Depends on formula or device\"\nscaling: \"Combat alchemy effects improve by rank.\"\nsynergy: \"Connects Artificer crafting to potions, bombs, catalysts, reagents, and battlefield utility.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-3\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 11\n---\n\n# Combat Alchemy\n\n## Overview\nCombat alchemy effects improve by rank.\n\n## Rank 1\nUnlock basic combat-ready alchemical applications.\n\n## Rank 2\nImprove potency, handling, and deployment reliability.\n\n## Rank 3\nCreate stronger tactical alchemical effects.\n\n## Rank 4\nSupport advanced battlefield mixtures and catalysts.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaster dangerous, high-impact combat alchemy.\n\n## Prerequisites\nArtificer Discipline Rank 3 or Alchemy access\n\n## Scaling\nCombat alchemy effects improve by rank.\n\n## Synergy\nConnects Artificer crafting to potions, bombs, catalysts, reagents, and battlefield utility.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n",
