      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Portable Structure\"\nslug: \"portable-structure\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 5\"\ntier: \"Tier 5\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"Dimensional Warehouse Rank 4\"\ncost: \"1 Talent Point\"\ncooldown: \"Passive\"\nscaling: \"Portable structure size, deployment stability, and complexity improve by rank.\"\nsynergy: \"Turns Artificer logistics into shelters, mobile workshops, field bases, and campaign infrastructure.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-5\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 19\n---\n\n# Portable Structure\n\n## Overview\nPortable structure size, deployment stability, and complexity improve by rank.\n\n## Rank 1\nDeploy a small portable structure or field shelter.\n\n## Rank 2\nImprove structure capacity and reliability.\n\n## Rank 3\nSupport workshop-grade portable infrastructure.\n\n## Rank 4\nDeploy more complex and durable structures.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaster portable bases and high-tier Artificer field architecture.\n\n## Prerequisites\nDimensional Warehouse Rank 4\n\n## Scaling\nPortable structure size, deployment stability, and complexity improve by rank.\n\n## Synergy\nTurns Artificer logistics into shelters, mobile workshops, field bases, and campaign infrastructure.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n",
